      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Abdominal wall endometriosis (AWE) often occurs in the surgical scar of a previous Caesarean section. In females with unexplained lower abdominal and pelvic pain who have had a C-section, the abdominal wall should be carefully examined to rule out AWE."},
